{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "bbd43c2c1d49d1ba82ff2066a872f740ca487e942528465ed39fe1640ab2e0fd", "ja": "いい子、ガチンコ", "zh": "好孩子，认真决胜负", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5f98091acebe72e97051fbffdce7f401a16acbb8a5fcc50c53dc0b75d4908cf9", "ja": "劇場に漂ういい匂いに、プロデューサーが向\nかってみれば、ケーキを焼いてみんなにふる\nまう育と伊織の姿が。父親に渡せた育、自分\nで食べたという伊織。二人ともポイント獲得\nし、勝負は白熱していくのだった。", "zh": "剧场里飘荡着一股诱人的香味，制作人循着香味找去，发现育和伊织正在烤蛋糕，准备分给大家。育成功把蛋糕送给了父亲，伊织则说自己吃掉了。两人都获得了分数，比赛也愈发白热化了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7cdfb5aecca827fccbf3d62b17234c8f54702c30740e1596b045b529a40f5319", "ja": "（育と伊織のケーキ作りは、無事に終わった。\nふたりとも満足そうで何よりだったな……）", "zh": "（育和伊织的蛋糕制作顺利结束了。\n看到她们两个都一副满足的样子，真是太好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a5744b75bc548979e5e3db1e86b20dc0f349133d56b6c63fe5bbb3aa05915f20", "ja": "さて、こっちは動画の編集に励むとするか。\n……ん？　なんだかいい匂いがするような。", "zh": "那么，我也该努力剪辑视频了。\n……嗯？好像闻到了什么香味。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "da8581e6526f57acfcf972fff91f02f9913b55bec3fd8425a3ec232f25bc5581", "ja": "こら、あんたたち！　いくら伊織ちゃんの\nお手製だからって、争っちゃだめよ！", "zh": "喂，你们几个！就算这是伊织亲手做的，也不许争抢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "3e7436db74ba7ac581b47afcd6526103edbb4341a96d3e84f41620c6427da149", "ja": "みんなの分あるから、\n順番だよ！", "zh": "大家都有份，\n要按顺序来哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4e1091fca5879422f1e0ea0c5ca11484fbfda73d2954897deba0e8c33a0bb413", "ja": "この声は……行ってみるか。", "zh": "这个声音是……去看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1005_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "44a4fdda68523c9e2c3bd4ebf5ecc0dd27745b2e2df703706d9f26b5bb91d88d", "ja": "おお……いい匂いがすると思ったら、\nシフォンケーキだったのか。", "zh": "哦……我还想着是什么这么香，原来是戚风蛋糕啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a26e937d1ca6a7996c5db249f4437744036e8bb3ce47a524ce98e979723c93c2", "ja": "しかもこんなにたくさん……。\nまた、ふたりで焼いたのか？", "zh": "而且还有这么多……。\n又是你们两个一起烤的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "458bf5fc276a85dabf3ec20095a1752292d073559f9ae48e42c7a623026f0556", "ja": "うん！　今度は伊織さんのおうちで！\n劇場のみんなにも食べてほしかったから。", "zh": "嗯！这次是在伊织小姐家做的！\n因为想让剧场的大家也尝尝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "ceced5ba216d284a39c764d88005b22b7e2c8d6d5f04974d159ecb9e5e702dbe", "ja": "おいしい……！\nくちどけも軽くて、甘すぎなくて……。", "zh": "好好吃……！\n入口即化，甜度也恰到好处……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "0ed0c216c6acc44db4d5fdf5e3cb8149ad36e2dbe667b630b8722712a1a78049", "ja": "おやぶん、ケーキすっごくおいしいぞ～！", "zh": "老大，这蛋糕好好吃啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "04e6fdd6647f9216c82feed2d5458b73c5903b6ee634df0e629b4f314b3539fe", "ja": "あっ。環、ついてるよ。\nもう、仕方ないんだから……。", "zh": "啊。环，你脸上沾到了。\n真是的，拿你没办法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "be695d60a177791e2b58ec3e8b774171c796d0732d7fde1c6591e35f64508f85", "ja": "ありがとー！\n……あれ、ももこもついてる？", "zh": "谢谢你～！\n……咦，桃子脸上也沾到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "4b25075a1d6895693e8c1c06fd927a53017e5a825a9f9ca326bd1a622619100f", "ja": "！！　い、今、ちょうど\n口を拭こうと思ってたところだから……！", "zh": "！！我、我正好正打算擦嘴来着……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "16f143a5486a12aae12417484f94de290f765fe4fe8851dad93b4e523748d640", "ja": "よかったぁ♪\nがんばって作ったかいがあったね！", "zh": "太好了♪\n辛苦做出来总算没有白费呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "216e218e81d71d9b565b4cd9dd93b37ec8851e1f9e27a5ca554acdb7de651ccc", "ja": "本当においしいねー！\n……これを伊織が焼いたの？　本当に？", "zh": "真的很好吃呢——！\n……这是伊织烤的吗？真的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "92a53a3cfaeca24195d34c1e4294c5b596ad3892061a1f32897cf5779abc7da7", "ja": "疑うなら食べなくてもいいのよ？　響。\n他のみんなにあげるだけだから。", "zh": "要是怀疑的话，不吃也行啊？响。\n反正给其他人吃就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "c2899fabcc7e8b47aa6885c1c92f8a034c5a34a8b08bb7a28f6d1c55fb5f16a1", "ja": "わー！　待って待って！\n伊織がお菓子作りなんて珍しいと思ってさ。", "zh": "哇！等等，等等！\n只是觉得伊织居然会做点心，真是少见啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "9977fbd45a47464fc5ecf85207aad47af20308bc44d59f1e49b03d1f92c47f7f", "ja": "たまたま手を出していなかっただけ。\n伊織ちゃんがちょっと本気を出せば、この通りよ。", "zh": "只是碰巧一直没动手而已。伊织稍微认真起来，就能做到这种程度哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "89b959e10dac766f0db2add919e286fd89dd281b76e4225df9c1b10d4750d231", "ja": "えへへ、さすが伊織ちゃんだね！\n今度、私にも作り方教えてね？", "zh": "嘿嘿，不愧是伊织！\n下次也教教我怎么做吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1020_005yay", "source_sha256": "1c0f297fe93121160c3c3d39e81694451f1fd889fcfa710cf85b0f1aa6d8b7ce", "ja": "私も節約レシピなら教えられるから！\nおからクッキーとか！", "zh": "我也会做节约食材的菜谱，可以教你哦！比如豆渣饼干之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1021_007ior", "source_sha256": "ce3d513a33214faf704868c90311fa4a5b7f4ff84a779ae25ef153abf6790945", "ja": "ええ、もちろん！\nやよいとお菓子作りも楽しそうね。", "zh": "嗯，当然可以！\n和弥生一起做点心也很有意思呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1022_p", "source_sha256": "bfc103f7259b73b6862302c511678a0342043296206e88c4206bf60b626cd853", "ja": "劇場のみんなに差し入れしてくれるとは……。\n俺のやるべきことをやってもらってしまったな。", "zh": "居然还给剧场的大家送来了慰问品……你替我做了本该由我来做的事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1023_p", "source_sha256": "1551cc34c9e9b556117a5c68c94451f9015f2b227b7a17ed1515787f986cb8d7", "ja": "育、伊織。\nふたりとも『いい子ポイント』を贈呈だ。", "zh": "育、伊织，你们两个都获得“乖孩子积分”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1024_030iku", "source_sha256": "f74cf7583634b0f835f8482fd3ad83050f7b61e12abc37ab08e0fa75403e3b97", "ja": "やったー！／当然ね♪", "zh": "太好了——！／那是当然的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1025_007ior", "source_sha256": "c5b7a5606c246990b39fc0ae6c56076dc929e3c4b718e04f838376242638bbd3", "ja": "当然ね♪", "zh": "那是当然的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1026_p", "source_sha256": "4c8588df7308e85ab9d1919521910e2fd5d6b6e75e7952755990f579e0c30a00", "ja": "それと……この間はバタバタしてて、\nふたりにまだポイントをあげてなかったな。", "zh": "还有……前段时间一直忙忙乱乱的，还没给你们两个发积分呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1027_p", "source_sha256": "fda0dd868455838927f489e1838e2647e9d9c1bbc7987a87059f8e329143dda3", "ja": "育は、お父さんに作ってあげたんだったな。\nいい子だ！", "zh": "育是做给爸爸的，对吧。真是个好孩子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1028_030iku", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1029_p", "source_sha256": "8a31c4567c67570b45292b495876893be8c8d2029fb51305dabb2a258d03533a", "ja": "伊織の方は……。", "zh": "伊织那边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1030_007ior", "source_sha256": "ebd6e1519bc878805fa6d379d070a95c843d12717394e76fe5f08e7fc0a94eb6", "ja": "……。\nあのケーキは、自分のために作ったのよ。", "zh": "……。\n那个蛋糕，是我做给自己吃的啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1031_007ior", "source_sha256": "7dae8180efdc20d5548396c8091a8c84431a89e18c4f50551ef67a690b809e74", "ja": "だから、私が食べたの。\n誰かにあげるためのものじゃないわ。", "zh": "所以，是我吃掉的。\n那并不是要送给别人的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1032_p", "source_sha256": "84d81d022376a1be9176a36aaab2a537117cd54e713c5be2a7b45bfc0f79bf8d", "ja": "そうか。\nでも、ポイントは加えられるべきだと思う。", "zh": "这样啊。\n不过，我觉得还是应该加上积分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1033_007ior", "source_sha256": "9a7968bc3145388ae373c0a91fb37aaa7e1cd24c79ae8ddc1cd0219315b15a14", "ja": "……。\nそれじゃ、筋が通らないんじゃないの？", "zh": "……这样的话，不就说不通了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1034_p", "source_sha256": "94d89b2c32481754e2acf087e51e7aa160d61506a55c85aa53747f6ba4621011", "ja": "育の手伝いをしていたじゃないか。\n今回は勝負で、競い合うライバルのはずなのに。", "zh": "你之前不是还帮过育吗？这次明明是比赛，你们应该是互相竞争的对手才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1035_p", "source_sha256": "679d40175fc8569fc081a2502cb2b8b778f023da0522d430ae1661f745323364", "ja": "これは間違いなく『いい子』だと思う。\nその行動に対してのポイントだ。", "zh": "这毫无疑问就是“好孩子”吧。\n这是针对那种行为的评价。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
