{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1037_007ior", "source_sha256": "2ee602ad0f92ec4e0f22bf64535bbf6c84cf8af670bb49e8ac65bd540868611d", "ja": "ま、そういうことなら、もらっておいてあげる。\nでも、つまらないんじゃない？", "zh": "嘛，既然你都这么说了，那我就收下吧。\n不过，不觉得很无聊吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1038_p", "source_sha256": "75a26b7fb179b1846e14c63e78016933042f08f307d29fa661ee447a01b572bf", "ja": "つまらない？", "zh": "无聊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1039_007ior", "source_sha256": "065bdce24573020cf38bae4b9bd8725886ac7cf1843c3562307e54df1a5e2186", "ja": "ええ。だって伊織ちゃんを正当に評価し続けたら、\nトップを独走することになっちゃうもの。", "zh": "嗯。因为要是一直公正地评价伊织的话，她可就要遥遥领先了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1040_013hib", "source_sha256": "e40f4a8d1323de92ade52f5b272447952954b3cd5d65c7b37bf1e41746174b7c", "ja": "言ったな伊織！\n自分、伊織には絶対負けないぞ！", "zh": "伊织，话可说出去了！\n我绝对不会输给伊织的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_06_1041_040tam", "source_sha256": "6b1a895e5110eb5d2077b94317b991eb0b1a4cc1acb32c03f21b5ef98d853a31", "ja": "たまきも！\n絶対、くらいついていくからね！", "zh": "环也一样！\n我一定会紧紧跟上的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
